%!PS-Adobe-3.0
%%Pages: 1
%%BoundingBox: 0 0 612 792
%%Page: 1 1

/left 48 def
/y 744 def

/normalFont { /Helvetica findfont 10 scalefont setfont } def
/headFont { /Helvetica-Bold findfont 17 scalefont setfont } def
/sectionFont { /Helvetica-Bold findfont 12 scalefont setfont } def

/line {
  /txt exch def
  left y moveto txt show
  /y y 13 sub def
} def

/section {
  /txt exch def
  sectionFont
  left y moveto txt show
  /y y 16 sub def
  normalFont
} def

/bullet {
  /txt exch def
  left 10 add y moveto (- ) show
  txt show
  /y y 12 sub def
} def

headFont
left y moveto (Ink Note - One-Page App Summary) show
/y y 24 sub def
normalFont

(What it is) section
(Ink Note is a React + Vite note workspace with draggable note windows.) line
(Notes can reference each other to form a graph, and workspace access is auth-gated with Clerk.) line
/y y 6 sub def

(Who it is for) section
(Primary persona: Not found in repo.) line
(Inferred from UI copy: users who link ideas and navigate notes visually.) line
/y y 6 sub def

(What it does) section
(Create draggable and resizable note windows on a full-screen canvas.) bullet
(Edit rich-text note content and rename notes with slug-style IDs.) bullet
(Link notes with at-mentions; links are stored as note-to-note connections.) bullet
(Show a live background graph of note relationships; click nodes to open notes.) bullet
(Search notes by title with a command-style panel and keyboard navigation.) bullet
(Show a recent-notes rail for one-click reopen and context recovery.) bullet
(Provide auth, account controls, and a light or dark theme toggle.) bullet
/y y 6 sub def

(How it works - architecture from repo evidence) section
(React app mounts in src/main.tsx with ClerkProvider and ConvexProviderWithClerk.) line
(App.tsx gates UI by auth state: AuthLandingScreen when signed out, WorkspaceShell when signed in.) line
(State lives in a persisted Zustand store in src/store/useStore.ts, including notes and window state.) line
(The persist key is ink-note-storage, and theme preference is saved in localStorage.) line
(NoteEditor with TipTap and Mention updates HTML content.) line
(updateNote parses data-id spans into connections for graph edges.) line
(selectGraphIndex and buildGraphIndex derive adjacency maps.) line
(BackgroundGraph renders nodes and edges with react-three-fiber and opens notes via store actions.) line
(Convex app-specific functions or schema definitions: Not found in repo.) line
/y y 6 sub def

(How to run - minimal getting started) section
(1. Install dependencies: pnpm install) line
(2. Set .env.local values used by code: VITE_CONVEX_URL and VITE_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY.) line
(3. Start the app: pnpm dev) line
(4. If running your own Convex auth setup, configure CLERK_JWT_ISSUER_DOMAIN for convex/auth.config.ts.) line

showpage
%%EOF
